  "system": {
    "identifier": "binding-fury-juggernaut",
    "description": "<p>Once you get started there's no stopping your momentum. At the beginning of each of your turns, you can cast this jutsu. If you do, you gain a rank of Fury as if under the effects of Binding Fury Stance.  If you do not spend your Fury as part of casting a Bukijutsu before the end of the current turn, you suffer harsh and echoing feedback, taking 4d8 Chakra damage.  If you do spend your Fury, you suffer no feedback.</p>",
